leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: draws gCobra2DL in the XLU pass with no color or matrix of its own; the display list name gives no hint beyond that it is the second cobra piece
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Cobra/z_bg_jya_cobra.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
